    "Titles": {
        "eng": "Tomica Kizuna Gattai Earth Granner",
        "jpn": "トミカ絆合体 アースグランナー"
    },
    "Summaries": {
        "eng": "The anime centers on the battles between the mysterious alien enemy Dark Spinner and the secret defense unit Earth Granner over Earth Energy, the energy generated from the Earth's rotation.",
        "jpn": "地球の自転エネルギーから放たれるアースエナジーを狙って、宇宙から謎の敵ダークスピナーが現れた！彼らの野望を食い止めるべく立ち向かうのが、双子の兄弟――ライガとクウガ、そして地球防衛隊『アースグランナー』――果たして彼らは地球を守ることができるのか！？ゆけ！少年たちよ！ ゆけ！ アースグランナー！"
    },
    "Aliases": [
        "Tomika Kizuna Gattai",
        "Tomica Kizuna Gattai: Earth Granner",
        "Tomica Bond Combination Earth Granner",
        "Tomika Kizuna Gattai: Earth Granner",
        "Tomica Kizuna Mode Combine Earth Granner",
        "Tomika Kizuna Gattai Āsu Gurannā",
        "Tomika Kizuna Gattai Aasu Gurannaa",
        "Power Car Enginebot",
        "Tomika Kizuna Gattai Āsu Guran'nā"
    ],
    "Modified": "2025-06-05",
    "Seasons": {
        "1": {
            "ID": "1832841",
            "URL": "https://thetvdb.com/series/379920-/seasons/official/1",
            "Titles": {
                "eng": null,
                "jpn": null,
                "kor": null
            },
            "Summaries": {
                "eng": "Earth Energy is a force generated naturally by the Earth's rotation. A mysterious alien enemy from space known as \"Dark Spinner\" has invaded Earth in order to steal the Earth Energy and transform it into Dark Energy. The only ones who can stand up to stop them are twin brothers named Raiga and Kuga, who are fighting together with the earth defense team Earth Granner. But will they be able to protect the earth?",
                "jpn": null,
                "kor": "지구의 자전 에너지로부터 뿜어져 나오는 어스에너지를 노리고, 우주로부터 수수께끼의 적 다크스피너가 나타났다!\r\n그들의 야망을 막을 수 있도록 맞서는 것이 쌍둥이 형제 라이가와 쿠우가, 그리고 지구방위대 어스그랜너 과연 그들은 지구를 지킬 수 있을까!? 가라, 소년들아! 가라, 어스그랜너!"
            },
